:: ======= 医院处女膜修复 ======
:: Hospital Hymen Reconstruction
<<fromopt>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
<<generate1>><<person1>>
接待员在电脑上敲了几下，指示你在等候室里坐下。
<br><br>
<<endevent>>

<<harper_intro>>

"这是一个简单的手术。" <<He>>从桌子上拿出一本手册。 "处女膜修复术主要针对破裂后的处女膜，通过缝合或重建恢复其形态。"
<<He>>指向你的<<pussy>>。
<br><br>

"修复你不小心丢掉的童贞需要£1000，不算特别贵，但是我们的手术很正规。"
<br><br>

<span style="filter: hue-rotate(30.00085deg) saturate(0.15) brightness(4.30);"><img class="icon" src="img/misc/icon/shave_clean_f.png"></span>
<<link [[修复处女膜|Hospital Hymen Reconstruction 2]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Hospital Foyer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Hospital Hymen Reconstruction 2
<<fromopt>>
"这将花费<span class="gold">£1000</span>，"<<he>>说，"手术全程一个小时，手术过后一周内不能剧烈运动，否则仍然会自己破裂，这样引起的修复失败我们概不负责，请你注意。"
<br><br>

<<if $money gte 100000>>
	<<ind>><<link [[接受 (1:00)|Hospital Hymen Reconstruction 3]]>><<pass 1 hours>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	你的钱不够。
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Hospital Foyer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Hospital Hymen Reconstruction 3
<<fromopt>>
<<money -100000 "hospitalHymenReconstruction">>

<<upperstrip>>
<<lowerstrip>>
<<underlowerstrip>>
<<underupperstrip>>
你向哈珀付了款。"请脱衣服，"<<he>>起身离开房间。
你脱掉衣服，站在原地等待——暴露的感觉很微妙。
<<if playerChastity()>>你移除不了你的$worn.genitals.cn_name_cap，希望这不成问题。<</if>>
<<He>>很快就带着一件手术服回来了。
<br><br>

"穿上这个，"<<he>>指了指衣服，你把手术服穿上。"好了，如果你愿意和我一起来，门就在前面。"
<br><br>

<<He>>带你走到另一个房间，里面有一张小床。"请躺下。我会给你麻醉，然后将你移到手术室。"你照做躺下。
<<He>>将一个面罩压在你的脸上，你感到意识开始涣散。当你失去知觉时，<<He>>从口袋里拿出一个相机。
<br><br>

<<fameexhibitionism 10 "pic">>

<<link [[继续|Hospital Hymen Reconstruction Done]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hospital Hymen Reconstruction Done
<<fromopt>>
<<set $player.virginity.vaginal to true>>
<<if $player.virginity.temple isnot false>><<set $player.virginity.temple to true>><</if>>
<<if $player.virginityDetails.vaginal>><<unset $player.virginityDetails.vaginal>><</if>>
<<set $hymenreconstructioncount to 7>>

你从昏迷中苏醒过来，周遭还是原来的房间。一切都似乎没有什么两样，除了你感觉你的<<pussy>>稍微有点疼痛。哈珀进入了房间。
<br><br>

"手术很成功，" <<he>>看着你的私处。
"你现在又是一名处女了，希望她能够一直保持下来。再次提醒你，<span class="red">之后一周内不能跑步、锻炼，或者进行任何的剧烈运动</span>，否则你身体里的那层薄膜仍然会自己破裂，这样引起的修复失败我们概不负责。"
<br><br>

<<He>>捻着写字板上的纸页。"你现在就可以走了……保重。"<<He>>留你一人穿好衣服。
<br><br>

<<endevent>>

<<link [[继续|Hospital Foyer]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>


:: ======= 理发店售卖头发 ====== [widget]
<<widget "hairDressersSellOptions">>
	<div id="hairDresserDiv">
		<div id="mannequin" @class="'mannequin ' + _hiddenMannequin" style="height:unset">
			<<mannequinHairdresser>>
		</div>
		<div>
			<<if $hairlength > 100>>
				<<set _haircutvalue to $hairlength - $hairOption>>
				<<set $currentEarn to _haircutvalue * 10>>
				<<if $haircolour isnot $naturalhaircolour>>
					<<set $currentEarn *= 0.8>> <!-- 染色后的头发价格降低20% -->
				<</if>>
				<<if $hairtexture is undefined>><<set $hairtexture to 50>><</if>>
				<<set $currentEarn to $currentEarn * (1 + ($hairtexture - 50) / 50 * 0.95)>>
				<<set $currentEarn to $currentEarn.toFixed(2)>>

				将你的两边剪至你的：
				<br>
				<<set _hairNames to ["耳朵", "下巴", "肩膀", "胸部上方", "胸部中间", "腹部上方", "肚脐", "大腿", "膝盖", "脚踝"]>>
				<<set _hairOptions to {"不剪发":$hairlength}>>
				<<for _i to 9; _i >= 0; _i-->>
					<<set $_length to (_i * 100) + 100>>
					<<if $_length + 50 < $hairlength>>
						<<set _hairOptions[_hairNames[_i]] to $_length>>
					<</if>>
				<</for>>
				<<listbox "$hairOption" autoselect>>
					<<optionsfrom _hairOptions>>
				<</listbox>>
			<<else>>
				你的头发长度不够，无法卖出。
			<</if>><br><br>
		</div>
	</div>

	<<if $currentEarn > 0>>
		<<hairdressericon "chair">><<link [[确认|Hairdressers Sell Hair Session]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Hairdressers]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</widget>>

:: Hairdressers Sell Hair
<<fromopt "@山有木兮">>
<<generate1>><<person1>>你坐了下来，理发师很快出现在你的身后。
<<if $hairtexture is undefined>><<set $hairtexture to 50>><</if>>
<<if $hairtexture > 99>>"这么柔软细腻的头发，你打算给你自己留多少？"
<<elseif $hairtexture > 75>>"是比较飘柔的头发，你打算给你自己留多少？"
<<elseif $hairtexture > 49>>"是蓬松垂顺的头发，你打算给你自己留多少？"
<<elseif $hairtexture > 25>>"你的头发有点变黄分叉，但是我们还是可以收。"
<<elseif $hairtexture > 12>>"你的头发干枯无光，但是我们还是可以低价收购。"
<<else>>"你的头发很粗燥，分叉严重，你要硬卖给我们，我们也只能做一些很残次的产品，价格不会很高。"
<</if>>
<br>
<<he>>告诉你，标准每斤是 <span class="gold">￡100</span>，但是这个价格还是具体看你的发质，并且如果是染过的头发，价格会更低。<br><br>
<<set $hairOption to $hairlength>>
<<set $fringeOption to $fringelength>>
<<set $dyeOption to "noChange">>
<<set $browsDyeOption to "noChange">>
<<set $twoToneDyeOption1 to "noChange">>
<<set $twoToneDyeOption2 to "noChange">>
<<set $twoToneHairDye to false>>
<<set $twoToneStyle to $hairColourGradient.style>>
<div id="currentEarn" class="gold">
	将会获得: £0
</div>
<div id="hairDressers">
	<<hairDressersSellOptions>>
</div>
<<run $(() =>
	$("#hairDressers").on("change", ".macro-listbox, .macro-radiobutton, .macro-checkbox", function (e) {
		Wikifier.wikifyEval("<<replace #hairDressers>><<hairDressersSellOptions>><</replace>>");
		Wikifier.wikifyEval('<<replace #currentEarn>>将会获得: £<<print $currentEarn / 100>><</replace>><<numberify "#passages > .passage">>');
	})
);>>

:: Hairdressers Sell Hair Session
<<fromopt "@山有木兮">>
在得到你肯定的答复后，<<he>>就开始做事了。
<br><br>
<<set _pass to 0>>
<<if $hairOption isnot $hairlength>>
	理发师开始剪头发，小心的一边剪下一定长度的头发一边收集，好好地保存在桌子上，并用刻度尺压着。过了会儿，<<he>>站起来，看着身旁的这些头发，点了点头。
	<br><br>
	<<set $hairlength to clone($hairOption)>>
	<<set _pass += 30>>
	<<unset $hairOption>>
<</if>>
<<pass _pass>>
<<calchairlengthstage>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Hairdressers]]>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<money $currentEarn "hairdressers">>
	<<unset $currentEarn>>
<</link>>


:: ======= 快速查看花园浇水 ====== [widget]
<<widget "checkgardenwatered">>
	<<if DolOptimization.data.ShowWaterState>>
		<<set _water_needed to 0>>
		<<set _plotsHere to $plots["garden"]>>
		<<if _plotsHere>>
			<br>
			<<for _plantbed range _plotsHere>>
				<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
					<<set _plantbed.water to 1>>    <!-- 下雨时自动淋湿 -->
					<<set _water_needed to 2>>
				<<elseif window.DolOptimization?.autoIrrigator("garden", _plantbed)>>
				<<elseif _plantbed.stage isnot 0 and _plantbed.water isnot 1>>
					<<set _water_needed to 1>>
					<<break>>
				<</if>>
			<</for>> 
			<<switch _water_needed>>
			<<case 0>><<gardenicon "flower">><span class="green">全部植圃都已经浇完水了。</span>
			<<case 1>><<gardenicon "water">><span class="purple">有植圃正处于干燥。</span>
			<<case 2>><<gardenicon "flower">><span class="green">植圃都被雨水淋湿了。</span>
			<</switch>>
			<<fromoptP>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Agricultural Supplies Shop
<<fromopt>>
你在农资店中。肥料的酸味和腥味扑面而来。
<br><br>

种子区: <br>
<<icon "seeds.png">>
<<link [[购买种子|Agricultural Supplies Shop Buyseeds]]>>
<</link>><br>
<br>

机器区: <br>
<<icon "automaticirrigationmachine.png">>
<<link [[购买自动灌溉机|Agricultural Supplies Shop Automaticirrigationmachine]]>>
<</link>> | <span class="gold">￡500</span><br>
<br>

肥料区: <br>
<<if $fertiliserripening is undefined>><<set $fertiliserripening to {current: 0, used: 0}>><</if>>
<<icon "fertiliser.png">>
<<if $money > 10000>>
	<<link [[购买肥料|$passage]]>>
		<<set $fertiliser.current++>>
		<<money -10000>>
	<</link>> | 拥有: <span class="gold"><<number $fertiliser.current>></span> | <span class="gold">￡100</span>
<<else>>
	购买肥料 | 拥有: <span class="gold"><<number $fertiliser.current>></span> | <span class="red">￡100</span>
<</if>><br>
<<icon "fertiliserripening.png">>
<<if $money > 15000>>
	<<link [[购买催熟肥|$passage]]>>
		<<set $fertiliserripening.current++>>
		<<money -15000>>
	<</link>> | 拥有: <span class="gold"><<number $fertiliserripening.current>></span> | <span class="gold">￡150</span>
<<else>>
	购买催熟肥 | 拥有: <span class="gold"><<number $fertiliserripening.current>></span> |  <span class="red">￡150</span>
<</if>><br>
<br>

<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>

:: Agricultural Supplies Shop Buyseeds
<<fromopt>>
你来到种子区，看着这些琳琅满目的种子，不知从何下手。
<br><br>
<span class="red">种子购买敬请期待</span>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回|Agricultural Supplies Shop]]>><</link>>

:: Agricultural Supplies Shop Automaticirrigationmachine
<<fromopt>>
你看着一排排的自动灌溉机。顶部印着“不退款！”的字样。<br><br>
<<if !$daily.shopcheckedautomaticirrigationmachine and ($arousal gte $arousalmax * 0.5 or $awareness gte 400)>>
	你感觉这些笨重的喷水机器不如你会喷。但是你知道它们不会休息……<<ggarousal>><<arousal 500>><br><br>
	<<set $daily.shopcheckedautomaticirrigationmachine to 1>>
<</if>>
<<icon "automaticirrigationmachine.png">>购买一台自动灌溉机:<br>
<<set _hasoption to 0>>
<<for _location, _plots range $plots>>
	<<switch _location>>
		<<case "garden">><<set _locationtext to "孤儿院花园">>
		<<default>><<set _locationtext to _location.split(' ').map(word => {return word.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + word.slice(1);}).join(' ')>>
	<</switch>>
	<<if $automaticirrigationmachines and $automaticirrigationmachines.hasOwnProperty(_location)>>
		<span class="green">_locationtext 处已经拥有了。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<set _hasoption to 1>>
		<<capture _location>>
			<<if $money > 50000>>
				<<link [[放置在 _locationtext 处|$passage]]>>
					<<money -50000>>
					<<if !$automaticirrigationmachines>><<set $automaticirrigationmachines to {}>><</if>>
					<<set $automaticirrigationmachines[_location] to 20>>
				<</link>> | <span class="gold">￡500</span>
			<<else>>
				放置在 _locationtext 处 | <span class="red">￡500</span>
			<</if>>
		<</capture>>
	<</if>><br>
<</for>>
<<if _hasoption is 0>>
	你没有地方可以放下这些笨重的自动灌溉机了。<br>
<</if>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回|Agricultural Supplies Shop]]>><</link>>

:: Agricultural Supplies Shop Lock
<<fromopt>>
农资店的大门紧闭，里面空无一人，没有在夜晚进去的必要。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>


:: ======= 遇欲便利店 ======= [widget]
<<widget "buyitem">>
	<<if V[_args[0]] is undefined>>
		<<set V[_args[0]] to 0>>
	<</if>>
	<<set V[_args[0]] += _args[1]>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "ConveniencestoreGoodItem">>
	<!-- <<ConveniencestoreGoodItem { icon: "图标执行段", name: "商品名", owned: 已拥有实参, price: 价格, per: 每售卖数量(数字或描述文本), inventory: 每日库存, apply: "售卖执行段", color: "默认语段颜色", unsable: true }>> -->
	<div class="ConveniencestoreGood">
		<<set _per to 1>>
		<<if $daily.conveniencestoregoods is undefined>>
			<<set $daily.conveniencestoregoods to {}>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $daily.conveniencestoregoods[_args[0].name] is undefined>>
			<<set $daily.conveniencestoregoods[_args[0].name] to _args[0].inventory>>
		<</if>>
		<<set _inventory to $daily.conveniencestoregoods[_args[0].name]>>

		<<print _args[0].icon>>
		_args[0].name
		<<if typeof _args[0].per is "number">>
			<<print '×'+_args[0].per>>
			<<set _per to _args[0].per>>
		<<elseif typeof _args[0].per is "string">>
			<<print _args[0].per>>
		<</if>>
		| 已拥有:<<print _args[0].owned??"0">> | <span class="gold">￡_args[0].price</span>

		<span style="word-break: keep-all;">
			<<if _inventory lt _per>>
				<span class="red">库存不足</span>
			<<else>>
				<span class="gold">库存:_inventory</span>
			<</if>>
		</span>
		<<if $money lt _args[0].price*100>>
			| <span class="red">支付不起</span>
		<<elseif _inventory lt _per>>
		<<else>>
			| <<capture _per>>
				<<link [[购买|$passage]]>>
					<<set $daily.conveniencestoregoods[_args[0].name] -= _per>>
					<<set _default to _args[0].color?[_args[0].icon, _per, _args[0]]:undefined>>
					<<set $conveniencestoregoodtobuy to [_args[0].name, _args[0].price*100, _args[0].apply, _default]>>
				<</link>>
			<</capture>>
		<</if>>
	</div>
<</widget>>
<<widget "ConveniencestoreGoodsImage">>
	<!-- 按每日库存把商品分层绘制到单个 canvas（crop 为 2048 画布内可见区左上角，canvas 为可见区尺寸）。绘制逻辑在 javascript/dol-optimization.js 的 conveniencestoreGoodsImage -->
	<!-- 槽位只给最内/最外两排的左右端点，中间排由双线性插值生成，便于换商品或加品牌时直接复用同一槽位名 -->
	<!-- <<ConveniencestoreGoodsImage {base: "底图", cover: "玻璃罩", crop: [x, y], canvas: [宽, 高], grids: {"槽位名": {inner: [左端点, 右端点], outer: [左端点, 右端点], cols: 列数, rows: 排数, levels: 层数, levelStep: [x, y]}}, goods: {"商品名": {sprite: "精灵图", per: 每个精灵代表的库存单位数, grid: "槽位名"}}}。per 只在精灵与库存不同单位时不为 1（避孕套精灵以盒为单位、库存以个为单位，1 盒=2 个 → per 2）；与 ConveniencestoreGoodItem 的 per（一次购买数量）含义不同，两者不要混用。 -->
	<canvas class="csCanvas" @id="'cs_' + _args[0].base" @width="_args[0].canvas[0]" @height="_args[0].canvas[1]"></canvas>
	<<run window.DolOptimization?.conveniencestoreGoodsImage(_args[0])>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "ConveniencestoreGoodsApply">>
	<<set $phase to "buy">>
	<<if $conveniencestoregoodtobuy>>
		<<if $money gte $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[1]>>
			<<print '<<money -'+$conveniencestoregoodtobuy[1]+'>>'>>
			“给，这些是你的，要收好它们呀，欢迎下次光临！”遇欲将装了$conveniencestoregoodtobuy[0]的一个塑料袋递给你。
			<<print $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[2]>>
			<<if $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[3] isnot undefined>>
				<<note '+ $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[3][1] $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[0]' $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[3][2].color>>
				<<print $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[3][0]>>
				<<if $conveniencestoregoodtobuy[3][2].unsable>>
					<small class="black">前往 日志>可用物品 以使用</small>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="red">你支付不起$conveniencestoregoodtobuy[0]的价格。</span><br><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<unset $conveniencestoregoodtobuy>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "ConveniencestoreGoods">> <div id="ConveniencestoreGoods">
	<<set _tab to window.DolOptimization?._csTab ?? 0>>
	<div class="csTabs">
		<div @class="'csTab' + (_tab === 0 ? ' is-active' : '')">柜台</div>
		<div @class="'csTab' + (_tab === 1 ? ' is-active' : '')">货架</div>
		<div @class="'csTab' + (_tab === 2 ? ' is-active' : '')">便利店外</div>
	</div>
	<div class="csPanels"> <div class="csSpace" @data-cur="_tab">
	<div @class="'ConveniencestoreGoodsClass' + (_tab === 0 ? ' is-active' : '')">  <!-- 柜台 -->
		<<ConveniencestoreGoodsImage {
			base: "counter.png",
			cover: "counter-cover.png",
			crop: [-62, -333],
			canvas: [1932, 1386],
			grids: {
				"抽屉": {inner: [[1563, 1080], [1802, 1051]], outer: [[1563, 1444], [1802, 1415]], cols: 3, rows: 3},
				"烟柜": {inner: [[1007, 1092], [1251, 1092]], outer: [[973, 1116], [1217, 1116]], cols: 3, rows: 3, levels: 3, levelStep: [0, 158]},
			},
			goods: {
				"避孕套": {sprite: "counter-condom.png", per: 2, grid: "抽屉"},
				"香烟": {sprite: "counter-cigarette.png", per: 1, grid: "烟柜"},
			},
		}>>
		<div>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<condomicon>>",
				name: "避孕套",
				owned: $condoms,
				price: 30,
				per: 2,
				inventory: 18,
				apply: "<<gcondoms 2>><<condomicon>>",
			}>>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<pregnancytesticon>>",
				name: "验孕棒",
				owned: $pregnancyTest,
				price: 15,
				per: 1,
				inventory: 5,
				apply: "<<buyitem pregnancyTest 1>>",
				color: "pink",
			}>>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<icon 'cigarette.png'>>",
				name: "香烟",
				owned: $cigarette,
				price: 30,
				per: "一包8支",
				inventory: 27,
				apply: "<<buyitem cigarette 8>>",
				color: "teal",
				unsable: true,
			}>>
			<!-- <<set _lol to V.wardrobe.face.filter(x => x.variable === "lollipop").length + (V.worn.face.variable === "lollipop" ? 1 : 0) + (V.wornStacking.face?.filter(x => x.variable === "lollipop").length ?? 0)>>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<icon 'lollipop.png'>>",
				name: "棒棒糖",
				owned: _lol,
				price: 15,
				per: 1,
				inventory: 9,
				apply: "<<run window.DolOptimization?.lollipopBuy()>>",
				color: "pink",
			}>> -->
			<!-- more goods at 柜台 -->
		</div>
	</div>
	<div @class="'ConveniencestoreGoodsClass' + (_tab === 1 ? ' is-active' : '')">  <!-- 货架 -->
		<<ConveniencestoreGoodsImage {
			base: "shelf.png",
			cover: "shelf-cover.png",
			crop: [-76, -322],
			canvas: [1927, 1487],
			grids: {
				"右下角": {inner: [[871, 1361], [1415, 1361]], outer: [[871, 1422], [1472, 1422]], cols: 9, rows: 3},
			},
			goods: {
				"能量饮料": {sprite: "shelf-energydrink.png", per: 1, grid: "右下角"},
			},
		}>>
		<div>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<icon 'energydrink.png'>>",
				name: "能量饮料",
				owned: $energydrink,
				price: 5,
				per: 1,
				inventory: 27,
				apply: "<<buyitem energydrink 1>>",
				color: "teal",
				unsable: true,
			}>>
			<span class="black">更多商品还得等「遇欲」进货来</span>
			<!-- more goods at 货架 -->
		</div>
	</div>
	<div @class="'ConveniencestoreGoodsClass' + (_tab === 2 ? ' is-active' : '')"> <!-- 便利店外 -->
		<<ConveniencestoreGoodsImage {
			base: "foodstuff.png",
			cover: "foodstuff-cover.png",
			crop: [-207, -451],
			canvas: [1688, 1212],
			grids: {
				"番茄": {inner: [[325, 498], [463, 498]], outer: [[367, 783], [560, 783]], cols: 3, rows: 7},
				"苹果": {inner: [[669, 475], [833, 475]], outer: [[724, 752], [888, 752]], cols: 3, rows: 7},
				"鸡蛋": {inner: [[1095, 565], [1293, 565]], outer: [[1156, 813], [1354, 813]], cols: 5, rows: 8},
				"橙子": {inner: [[1446, 505], [1584, 505]], outer: [[1515, 793], [1653, 793]], cols: 3, rows: 7},
			},
			goods: {
				"番茄": {sprite: "foodstuff-tomato.png", per: 1, grid: "番茄"},
				"苹果": {sprite: "foodstuff-apple.png", per: 1, grid: "苹果"},
				"鸡蛋": {sprite: "foodstuff-egg.png", per: 1, grid: "鸡蛋"},
				"橙子": {sprite: "foodstuff-orange.png", per: 1, grid: "橙子"},
			},
		}>>
		<div>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<foodstufficon 'chicken_egg'>>",
				name: "鸡蛋",
				owned: $foodstuff.chicken_egg.amount,
				price: 2,
				per: 4,
				inventory: 40,
				apply: "<<set $foodstuff.chicken_egg.amount += 4>>",
				color: "gold",
			}>>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<foodstufficon 'tomato'>>",
				name: "番茄",
				owned: $foodstuff.tomato.amount,
				price: 2,
				per: 3,
				inventory: 21,
				apply: "<<set $foodstuff.tomato.amount += 3>>",
				color: "gold",
			}>>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<foodstufficon 'apple'>>",
				name: "苹果",
				owned: $foodstuff.apple.amount,
				price: 1,
				per: 3,
				inventory: 21,
				apply: "<<set $foodstuff.apple.amount += 3>>",
				color: "gold",
			}>>
			<<ConveniencestoreGoodItem {
				icon: "<<foodstufficon 'orange'>>",
				name: "橙子",
				owned: $foodstuff.orange.amount,
				price: 2,
				per: 1,
				inventory: 21,
				apply: "<<set $foodstuff.orange.amount += 1>>",
				color: "gold",
			}>>
			<!-- more goods at 便利店外 -->
		</div>
	</div>
	<!-- more goods -->
	</div> </div>
</div> <</widget>>


:: Conveniencestore
<<fromopt>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	你透过玻璃看到便利店里面一片漆黑。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Domus Street]]>><</link>>
<<else>>

<<if $conveniencestorestat is undefined>>
	<<set $conveniencestorestat to 0>>
<</if>>

<<if DolOptimization.full>>
	<<npc Needmeet>> <<initnpc Needmeet>>
<</if>>

<<if $conveniencestoregoodtobuy>>
	<<ConveniencestoreGoodsApply>>
<</if>>

<<switch $phase>>
	<<case undefined>>
		<<set $phase to 0>>
		<<set $conveniencestoreshowgoods to 1>>
		<<set $conveniencestoreshowgetouts to 1>>
		<<if $conveniencestorestat is 0>>
			<div style="max-width: 23em;">
				<<ConveniencestoreGoodsImage {
					base: "counter.png",
					cover: "counter-cover.png",
					crop: [-62, -333],
					canvas: [1932, 1386],
					grids: {
						"抽屉": {inner: [[1563, 1080], [1802, 1051]], outer: [[1563, 1444], [1802, 1415]], cols: 3, rows: 3},
						"烟柜": {inner: [[1007, 1092], [1251, 1092]], outer: [[973, 1116], [1217, 1116]], cols: 3, rows: 3, levels: 3, levelStep: [0, 158]},
					},
					goods: {
						"避孕套": {sprite: "counter-condom.png", per: 2, grid: "抽屉"},
						"香烟": {sprite: "counter-cigarette.png", per: 1, grid: "烟柜"},
					},
				}>>
			</div>
			<br><br>
			"啊太好了！又是一名新顾客，我要记在小本本上，"
			你抬头看去，柜台的健硕男生，一头乌黑短卷发，
			带着一副黑框眼睛，长得很高脸却特别可爱，
			一身<<if Time.season is "winter">>干净的白色冲锋衣<<else>>利落的白色上衣<</if>>，
			手中拿着小本本和笔在写着什么。
			<br><br>
			"需要点什么？"他边写边问。
			<br><br>
			<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[询问有什么|$passage]]>><<set $phase to "askgoods">><</link>><br>
			<<if C.npc.Needmeet?.love lte 0>>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[询问他在干什么|$passage]]>><<set $phase to "askdoing">><</link>><br>
			<</if>>
			<<set $conveniencestoreshowgoods to 0>>
			<<set $conveniencestoreshowgetouts to 0>>
		<<else>>
			"叮咚~" 门口的铃声在你踏进门的一刻响起，随即身旁传来一阵男声："欢迎光临遇欲便利店，有什么我能够帮你的？"<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<<case "askgoods">>
		你四处张望：“我之前没见过你啊，这是新开的店铺？”<br>
		“嗯，我是最近才搬来这座小镇的，”面前男生害羞的抠了抠脑袋，“我叫 H…… ，啊，你叫我「遇欲」吧。”<br><br>
		“OK，「遇欲」，那你这里有点什么？”<br>
		“嗯，我带你看看！”他微笑着回答到。<br><br>
		<<set $conveniencestoreshowgoods to 1>>
		<<set $conveniencestoreshowgetouts to 1>>
		<<if C.npc.Needmeet?.love lte 0>>
			<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[询问他手中的本子|$passage]]>><<set $phase to "askdoing">><</link>><br><br>
		<</if>>
	<<case "askdoing">>
		<<set C.npc.Needmeet.love to 1>>
		“啊，你说这个啊”。他抬头看向你，露出一抹可爱的微笑，抬手晃了晃手中的小本子。<br>
		“这个是我的记录本，我会把附近每一个来过的顾客都记录上去，他们每天买点什么，一般什么时候来，什么性格特征啥的，”他说的同时翻了翻手中的本子。<br>
		本子很厚，但是目前写完的页数并不多。你故意去瞄了一眼，看见每一页上面都写的规规整整、满满当当。<br><br>
		“哈哈，别管这些了，还是你看看需要点什么，”他笑着扯开了话题。 <br><br>
		<<if $conveniencestoreshowgoods is 0>>
			<span class="teal">或许让眼前这个男生更信任你，他会更加敞开心扉。</span><br><br>
			<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[询问有什么|$passage]]>><<set $phase to "askgoods">><</link>><br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">或许让「遇欲」更信任你，他会更加敞开心扉。</span><br><br>
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		"还有什么我能帮你？"「遇欲」微笑着看向你。<br><br>
<</switch>>

<<if $conveniencestoreshowgoods>>
	<<ConveniencestoreGoods>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<if $conveniencestoreshowgetouts>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|Domus Street]]>><<endevent>>
		<<unset $phase>>
		<<unset window.DolOptimization._csTab>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

<<if $daily.conveniencestoreenter isnot 1>>
	<<set $conveniencestorestat++>>
	<<set $daily.conveniencestoreenter to 1>>
<</if>>

<!-- 天黑反tag --> <</if>>

:: UsableItems[widget]
<<widget "usableitem">>
	<div>
		<<icon _args[0]>>_args[1] <<print _args[2]>> <br>
		<<ind>> 拥有: <<print _args[3]??"0">>_args[4] | 
		<<if $event !== undefined || $combat === 1 || $masturbating === 1 || $passage.endsWith("Finish")>>
			<span class="red">无法使用: 处于事件中</span>
		<<elseif _args[3] and _args[3] gt 0>>
			<<link [[_args[5]|$passage]]>> <<print _args[7]>> <</link>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="red">数量不足: _args[6]</span>
		<</if>>
		<<if _args[8]>> <br> 
			<<ind>><<print _args[8]>>
		<</if>>
	</div>
<</widget>>
<<widget "usableitems">> <div class="usableitems">
	<<set _nicotinetext to "<span>不染烟习</span>">>
	<<if $nicotine gte 95>>
		<<set _nicotinetext to "<span class='red'>嗜烟如命</span>">>
	<<elseif $nicotine gte 80>>
		<<set _nicotinetext to "<span class='purple'>难断烟思</span>">>
	<<elseif $nicotine gte 60>>
		<<set _nicotinetext to "<span class='blue'>欲罢不能</span>">>
	<<elseif $nicotine gte 40>>
		<<set _nicotinetext to "<span class='lblue'>渐成习惯</span>">>
	<<elseif $nicotine gte 20>>
		<<set _nicotinetext to "<span class='teal'>浅尝辄止</span>">>
	<<elseif $nicotine gt 0>>
		<<set _nicotinetext to "<span class='green'>兴致寥寥</span>">>
	<</if>>
	<<usableitem "cigarette.png" "香烟" "<<lllarousal>><<ltiredness>><<lllstress>><<gnicotine>>" $cigarette "支" "来一根" "来源: 遇欲便利店" "
		<<set $cigarette -= 1>>
		<<set _k to ((100 - Math.min(($nicotine??0), 95)) / 100)>>
		<<set _t to Math.floor(-3000*_k)-1>>
		<<arousal _t>>
		<<set _t to Math.floor(-9*_k)-1>>
		<<tiredness _t>>
		<<set _t to Math.floor(-23*_k)-1>>
		<<stress _t>>
		<<if $nicotine is undefined>>
			<<set $nicotine to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $nicotine += 1>>
	" "尼古丁依赖: _nicotinetext&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(尼古丁依赖越大，香烟的效果会越小)">>
	<<usableitem "energydrink.png" "能量饮料" "<<lpain>><<llltiredness>>" $energydrink "瓶" "饮用" "来源: 遇欲便利店" "
		<<set $energydrink -= 1>>
		<<pain -2>>
		<<tiredness -18>>
	">>
	<!-- more usableitems -->
</div> <</widget>>

<<widget "gnicotine">>
	<<note "+ 尼古丁依赖" "purple">>
<</widget>>
